# "Templating" today: read a file and replace placeholders (no escaping).
name is "<b>Ann</b>"
read "page.tpl" into page
replace "{{name}}" with name in page
say page
token is secure random bytes 32
tokenText is hex from bytes token
say length of tokenText
data is bytes from text "sid=abc"
key is bytes from text "server-secret"
signature is hmac sha256 of data using key
say hex from bytes signature
hello is bytes from text "hello"
digest is sha256 of hello
say hex from bytes digest
hash password "correct horse" and call it stored
if password "correct horse" matches hash stored
    say "password ok"
